{#- Tarifas tab pane injected into catalogo_core's ventas_articulo page (WU-1).
    Owned by catalogo_core after the article surface move and migrated to
    htmx 4 + Alpine CSP (AD-6). Boot ownership flipped to the host in WU-2
    (AD-W2-3): the canonical ventas_articulo view owns the htmx/Alpine boot,
    so this injected pane MUST NOT boot again (it only keeps the [x-cloak]/
    x-data shell). Guarded like the header: nothing to price on an unsaved
    article. The tab header's hx-get swaps the rows placeholder; the save
    handler is the nonce'd Alpine component registered by the save-script
    partial. Bare no-argument currency helper calls are forbidden under
    View/Hooks (S28). -#}
{% if fsc.articulo is defined and fsc.articulo and fsc.articulo.referencia %}
<style>
   [x-cloak] {
      display: none !important;
   }
</style>
<div class="tab-pane" id="tab_tarifario_precios" data-tipo="articulo"
     x-data="articuloTabPrecios" x-cloak>
   <div class="callout tarifario-tab-msg" x-show="message" x-cloak
        :class="messageClass" x-text="message"></div>
   <div id="tab_tarifario_precios_rows">
      <p class="text-muted">Abre la pestaña para cargar los precios por tarifa.</p>
   </div>
</div>
{% include '@catalogo_core/Hooks/partials/tab_save_script.html.twig' %}
{% endif %}
